    subtitle={translate('workspace.categories.emptyCategories.subtitle')}
    containerStyle={[styles.flex1, styles.justifyContentCenter]}
/>
```

I'll need to find where these translation strings are defined to see what they are. I'll also need to investigate `PolicyUtils.isPolicyAdmin(policy)` to understand how it determines if a user is an admin.

I'll start by looking at the `PolicyUtils` file.

